{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36686","headline":"临川投穆中丞 · 罗隐","name":"临川投穆中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"试将生计问蓬根，心委寒灰首戴盆。\n翅弱未知三岛路，舌顽虚掉五侯门。\n啸烟白狖沈高木，捣月清砧触旅魂。\n家在碧江归不得，十年鱼艇长苔痕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}